                        "sense_id": "c2281161-75fb-38cd-b61e-530fd6edeaf7",
                        "entry_id": "9d1e9dce-1dd6-3e80-b375-d16b6f52d16f",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Synonym of sophisticated (adjective).",
                            "Of art or other things: appealing to the tastes of an intellectual or sophisticated (sense 1.1) person; cerebral; also, cultured, elegant, refined."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "e5110485-c8dd-3d14-92cc-ffeff08640c7",
                        "entry_id": "9d1e9dce-1dd6-3e80-b375-d16b6f52d16f",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Synonym of sophisticated (adjective).",
                            "Mixed with a foreign or inferior substance; not genuine or pure; adulterated, impure."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "obsolete"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "ae825d70-ad31-415c-8614-7ffc1a2f4bae",
                                "sense_id": "e5110485-c8dd-3d14-92cc-ffeff08640c7",
                                "text": "So truth, while only one ſupply'd the ſtate,\n Grew ſcarce, and dear, and yet ſophiſticate."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "b75931db-895e-32e6-8d76-1b3889b59303",
